#N canvas 60 60 900 494 12;
#X text 20 10 PV 5;
#X text 20 34 Pure Data / plugdata version. Needs the csound7~ external: see README.md in the pd folder of the repository;
#X msg 20 58 \; pd dsp 1;
#X msg 110 58 \; pd dsp 0;
#X text 200 58 audio on / off;
#X text 20 98 This lesson plays a sound file: 1) click the bang and choose a file from the audio folder of the repository \, 2) click start.;
#X obj 20 120 bng 18 250 50 0 empty empty empty 20 9 0 10 #fcfcfc #000000 #000000;
